message: "If you use INDUS-DEDUCT code, benchmark data, or restoration catalog, please cite this work."
title: "INDUS-DEDUCT: A Calibrated, Anti-Hallucination Computational Benchmark for the Indus Valley Script"
version: "1.1.0"
date-released: "2026-11-20"
type: software
